[2026-03-04T20:18:25.820Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01McLEA6aWPgys7YFqu7sPHV","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me compile a comprehensive report with all the relevant files for the Todo app:\n\n## Complete Todo App File Inventory and Documentation\n\n### Task Information\nThe task file indicates this is a **todo-app** project with the following build tasks:\n- Write components: Header, AddTodo, TodoItem, TodoList, FilterBar, SortDropdown\n- Write the main page (MainTodoList)\n\n---\n\n### 1. App Specification\n\n**File: `/repo/apps/todo-app/AppSpec.md`**\n\nThe Todo App is a task management application with:\n- Main page showing all todos with filtering and sorting\n- Edit modal for updating todo details\n- Data model with UUID id, title, completed, priority, due_date, notes, created_at, updated_at\n- API endpoints for CRUD operations (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE)\n\n---\n\n### 2. Test Specification\n\n**File: `/repo/apps/todo-app/docs/tests.md`**\n\nComprehensive Playwright test specifications covering:\n- **Header**: Title display, incomplete count calculation, count updates\n- **AddTodo**: Placeholder, enter-to-create, input validation, list insertion\n- **TodoList**: Checkbox toggle, strikethrough styling, delete button, due date formatting, priority badges\n- **FilterBar**: All/Active/Completed filters, Clear Completed button, filter persistence\n- **SortDropdown**: Newest/Oldest/Priority/Due Date sorting options\n- **EditTodoModal**: Title/Priority/DueDate/Notes fields, validation, save/cancel actions\n\n---\n\n### 3. Source Code Files\n\n#### Core Application Structure\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/main.tsx`** - React entry point with Redux Provider\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/App.tsx`** - Root component wrapping MainTodoList\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/index.css`** - Tailwind CSS with custom theme variables\n\n#### Types\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/types.ts`** - TypeScript interfaces for Todo, FilterType, SortType\n\n#### State Management (Redux Toolkit)\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/store/index.ts`** - Store configuration\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/store/hooks.ts`** - Typed useAppDispatch and useAppSelector\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/store/todosSlice.ts`** - Redux slice with async thunks:\n  - fetchTodos, addTodo, toggleTodo, updateTodo, deleteTodo, clearCompleted\n  - Actions: setFilter, setSort\n  - State: items, loading, error, filter, sort\n\n#### Components\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/components/Header.tsx`** - App title and incomplete count display\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/components/AddTodo.tsx`** - Input field for creating new todos\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/components/TodoItem.tsx`** - Individual todo item with checkbox, text, priority badge, due date, delete button\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/components/TodoList.tsx`** - Container for filtering and sorting todos\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/components/FilterBar.tsx`** - Filter buttons (All/Active/Completed) and Clear Completed\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/components/SortDropdown.tsx`** - Dropdown for sort options\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/components/EditTodoModal.tsx`** - Modal with title, priority, due date, notes fields\n\n#### Pages\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/src/pages/MainTodoList.tsx`** - Main page layout composing all components\n\n#### Backend Functions (Netlify)\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/netlify/functions/todos.ts`** - CRUD API endpoint for todos (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE)\n- **`/repo/apps/todo-app/netlify/functions/db.ts`** - Database connection helper using Neon\n\n---\n\n### 4. Configuration Files\n\n**`/repo/apps/todo-app/package.json`**\n- Dependencies: React 19.2.0, Redux Toolkit 2.11.2, Lucide React icons, Neon database\n- Dev Dependencies: Vite, Tailwind CSS 4.2.1, TypeScript, ESLint\n\n**`/repo/apps/todo-app/vite.config.ts`**\n- Vite with React and Tailwind plugins\n- Source maps enabled, minify disabled\n- Development environment configuration\n\n**`/repo/apps/todo-app/netlify.toml`**\n- Build command: npm run build\n- Functions directory: netlify/functions\n- Redirects for API and SPA routing\n\n**`/repo/apps/todo-app/tailwind.config.ts`** - File does not exist (using Tailwind CSS 4 with @theme in index.css)\n\n**TypeScript Configs:**\n- `/repo/apps/todo-app/tsconfig.json` - Main config\n- `/repo/apps/todo-app/tsconfig.app.json` - App-specific config\n- `/repo/apps/todo-app/tsconfig.node.json` - Node-specific config\n\n---\n\n### 5. Style Guide & Shared Code\n\n- **AppStyle.md at `/repo/apps/AppStyle.md`** - Does not exist\n- **AppStyle.md at `/repo/apps/todo-app/AppStyle.md`** - Does not exist\n- **Shared code at `/repo/apps/shared/`** - Directory does not exist\n\n---\n\n### 6. Technology Stack Summary\n\n- **Build Tool**: Vite 7.3.1\n- **UI Framework**: React 19.2.0\n- **State Management**: Redux Toolkit 2.11.2\n- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS 4.2.1 with custom theme\n- **Icons**: Lucide React 0.577.0\n- **Database**: Neon (PostgreSQL serverless)\n- **Backend**: Netlify Functions\n- **Language**: TypeScript 5.9.3 (strict mode)\n- **Linting**: ESLint 9.39.1 with React Hooks plugin\n\n---\n\n### 7. Key Features Implemented\n\n- Full CRUD operations for todos\n- Real-time filtering (All/Active/Completed)\n- Multiple sort options (Newest/Oldest/Priority/Due Date)\n- Priority levels (Low/Medium/High) with colored badges\n- Due date formatting (Today/Tomorrow/Overdue/specific date)\n- Edit modal with validation\n- Delete with confirmation\n- Responsive design (max-width 2xl container, mobile-optimized padding)\n- Redux state synchronization with backend API"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a15ea549fe4154b63 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 43595\ntool_uses: 34\nduration_ms: 29778</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"361211fa-f79e-48a3-8712-d3f40307c51b","uuid":"dd0052c4-5808-4ef6-bd76-bc0217fdd518","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","pr